=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4CorrelatedEquilibrium}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4CorrelatedEquilibrium}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}correlated\\text{-}equilibrium}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGame4CorrelatedEquilibrium}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow N\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec u))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;\\left(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\vec S(i))\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\left(\\vec u(i),\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j),\\mathbb R\\right)\\right)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\left(\\mu,\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j),[0,1]\\right)\\land\\sum_{s\\in\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)}\\mu(s)=1\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;\\forall a,a&#39;\\in\\vec S(i)\\;\\left(\\sum_{\\substack{s\\in\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)\\\\s(i)=a}}\\mu(s)\\bigl(\\vec u(i)(s)-\\vec u(i)(s[i\\mapsto a&#39;])\\bigr)\\geq0\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}correlated\\text{-}equilibrium}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGame4CorrelatedEquilibrium}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow N\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec u))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;\\left(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\vec S(i))\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\left(\\vec u(i),\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j),\\mathbb R\\right)\\right)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\left(\\mu,\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j),[0,1]\\right)\\land\\sum_{s\\in\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)}\\mu(s)=1\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;\\forall a,a&#39;\\in\\vec S(i)\\;\\left(\\sum_{\\substack{s\\in\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j)\\\\s(i)=a}}\\mu(s)\\bigl(\\vec u(i)(s)-\\vec u(i)(s[i\\mapsto a&#39;])\\bigr)\\geq0\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The inequality states that a player cannot gain by replacing any received recommendation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&#39;\">\\(a&#39;\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N,\\vec S,\\vec u,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\